cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Agentic Edition Pipeline"
version: "0.11.0"
abstract: >-
  A forkable repository template for digital edition workflows operated with an
  AI harness. It combines a knowledge base for the edition's decisions with
  Python scripts, prompts and data contracts for image transcription, quality
  assessment, TEI-XML generation, local correction and static publication.
  Research preview without a stable release, tested only on synthetic data.
authors:
